Package: forgemesh-control
Version: 0.1.3
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv, python3-pip, git, curl, xdg-utils
Recommends: chromium | google-chrome-stable | chromium-browser
Suggests: nodejs
Description: ForgeMesh central control plane for browser-driven AI councils
 ForgeMesh Control Center installs, verifies and orchestrates central coding
 agents, projects, the AI Council and mesh workers. It talks to the ForgeMesh
 Browser runtime (fmb) over HTTP and never stores cookies, passwords or session
 tokens.
 .
 This package ships the control server (fmc), the browser runtime CLI (fmb),
 the web dashboard, a desktop launcher and optional systemd user units.
 .
 Python dependencies are installed into a private virtual environment under
 /opt/forgemesh/venv during package configuration; an internet connection is
 required for that step.
